elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">三星电子发布2026年Q2财报：营业利润暴增1813.8%，AI存储成核心引擎</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">xAI发布Grok Voice Think Fast 2.0语音模型，提升转录准确率与智能体响应速度</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯正式开源 AngelSpec 框架，通过多方案协同提升大模型推理吞吐量</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/56a316bb9be45a2ce59bd7dff740e373.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯技术团队正式开源 AngelSpec 框架，旨在解决大模型自回归解码的高成本难题。该框架针对不同任务采用差异化策略：在多轮对话任务中，结合多token预测机制（MTP）、训练时测试（TTT）及端到端总变差损失以适应状态分布；在代码与数学推理任务中，利用专有块扩散模型挖掘长跨度序列潜力。核心架构 DFly 创新性地混合了目标条件编码骨干与前序条件自回归头，并引入动态验证机制，可根据在线负载、硬件条件及前缀置信度实时调整验证深度。在 Hy3 模型系列的测试中，搭载 DFly 的方案在 4 至 64 并发数下均实现最高平均吞吐量，显著优于传统自回归解码。AngelSpec 的开源为大模型工程化落地提供了高效推理工具，开发者可通过 GitHub 获取项目代码，相关技术细节已在论文中披露。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软确认开发Copilot AI超级应用，整合聊天、编程与智能代理能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6cac54587de973a64b1801adb05b2d26.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软首席执行官萨蒂亚·纳德拉在最新财报电话会议中确认，公司正在开发一款整合Copilot聊天、编码助手及智能代理能力的AI“超级应用”，计划于今年内正式推出，覆盖消费者与商业场景。该应用旨在将Copilot从单一聊天助手升级为协同办公与自动化执行平台，整合产品包括通用Copilot聊天机器人、GitHub Copilot、Copilot Cowork以及具备任务自动执行能力的智能代理系统。微软本季度将重点推动不同Copilot体验的统一，此举标志着AI助手竞争正从单一功能向综合型AI平台演进。在财务层面，人工智能与云业务已成为微软营收增长的核心驱动力。随着大型科技公司加速整合模型、工具与代理能力，AI超级应用有望成为未来企业及个人用户使用人工智能的关键入口。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">三星电子发布2026年Q2财报：营业利润暴增1813.8%，AI存储成核心引擎</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/966d11ec2d1e9035b153e6b09134c43b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">三星电子公布2026年第二季度财报，综合营收达171.5万亿韩元，同比增长130%；营业利润飙升至89.5万亿韩元，同比暴增1813.8%。半导体部门贡献超99%利润，成为绝对盈利引擎。产品层面，高性能HBM4已大规模出货，HBM4E样品完成交付，服务器DRAM及企业级SSD需求强劲。相比之下，手机业务录得7000亿韩元亏损，电视与白电业务亦出现小幅亏损，公司盈利结构呈现极度依赖半导体的“单引擎”模式。尽管业绩创历史新高，但受市场对AI资本开支周期见顶的担忧及内部治理问题影响，三星市值较6月峰值缩水四成。三星预计下半年AI基础设施投入将持续加码，智能体落地将进一步拉动存储需求。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">xAI发布Grok Voice Think Fast 2.0语音模型，提升转录准确率与智能体响应速度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/09656903ecd9ae90ac93424907c5c568.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">xAI正式发布新一代语音识别模型Grok Voice Think Fast 2.0，重点面向语音智能体开发者，在转录准确率、对话策略及工具调用效率上实现显著升级。该模型定价为每分钟0.08美元。在Artificial Analysis基准测试中，Think Fast 2.0综合得分达82.9%，智能体能力评分达56.5%，均优于GPT-Realtime-2.1及Gemini 3.1 Flash。技术性能方面，模型首次音频播放时间降至0.70秒，在复杂噪音环境下转录准确率较前代提升约1.4倍，较Deepgram Nova3等竞品提升1.5至2倍。通过支持语音并行推理及强化学习优化，模型推理标记使用量中位数降至0.4次，工具调用效率大幅提升。目前该模型已在Starlink电话服务中完成A/B测试。2026年8月5日</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
